s","book_id":"b-epitaph-wenshizhi-excerpts","work_id":"w-epitaph-wenshizhi","source_id":"s-epitaph-wenshizhi-excerpts"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line064","text":"放之嗣爵，少歷清官，累至給事黃門侍郎。以貧，求為交州，朝廷許之。王述與會稽王牋曰：「放之溫嶠之子，宜見優異，而投之嶺外，竊用愕然。願遠存周禮，近參人情，則望實惟允。」時竟不納。放之既至南海，甚有威惠。將征林邑，交阯太守杜寶、別駕阮朗並不從，放之以其沮眾，誅之，勒兵而進，遂破林邑而還。卒于官。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line064:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"放之","kind":"person","person_id":"6v8_pk9_7k5_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line064:m0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"王述","kind":"person","person_id":"a8f_ec8_e74_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line064:m0035","start":35,"end":38,"surface":"會稽王","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAF","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line064:m0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"放之","kind":"person","person_id":"6v8_pk9_7k5_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line064:m0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"溫嶠","kind":"person","person_id":"6v8_pk9_7k5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line064:m0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"放之","kind":"person","person_id":"6v8_pk9_7k5_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line064:m0109","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"杜寶","kind":"person","person_id":"9rh_zea_9ek","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line064:m0114","start":114,"end":116,"surface":"阮朗","kind":"person","person_id":"byi_mmu_o86","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line064:m0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"放之","kind":"person","person_id":"6v8_pk9_7k5_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":64,"last_line":64,"revision_id":2592755},"source_quote":{"witness":"j67","quote":"放之嗣爵，少歷清官，累至給事黃門侍郎。以貧，求為交州，朝廷許之。王述與會稽王牋曰：「放之溫嶠之子，宜見優異，而投之嶺外，竊用愕然。願遠存周禮，近參人情，則望實惟允。」時竟不納。放之既至南海，甚有威惠。將征林邑，交阯太守杜寶、別駕阮朗並不從，放之以其沮眾，誅之，勒兵而進，遂破林邑而還。卒于官。","raw_start":6266,"raw_end":6412,"raw_line":64},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao","book_id":"b-jinshu-067","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-067-wenqiao"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line066","text":"弟式之，新建縣侯，位至散騎常侍。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line066:m0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"式之","kind":"person","person_id":"6v8_pk9_7k5_B","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":66,"last_line":66,"revision_id":2592755},"source_quote":{"witness":"j67","quote":"弟式之，新建縣侯，位至散騎常侍。","raw_start":6414,"raw_end":6430,"raw_line":66},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao","book_id":"b-jinshu-067","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-067-wenqiao"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-epitaph-wenqiao-excerpts","work_id":"w-epitaph-wenqiao","book_id":"b-epitaph-wenqiao-excerpts","source_id":"s-epitaph-wenqiao-excerpts","source":{"title":"溫嶠墓誌","provider":"林宗閱據南京市博物館刊拓錄文","url":"https://homepage.ntu.edu.tw/~history/public_html/newsletter/public_html/09newsletter/04/newsletter4_23.pdf","permalink":"https://homepage.ntu.edu.tw/~history/public_html/newsletter/public_html/09newsletter/04/newsletter4_23.pdf","revision_id":null,"accessed_on":"2026-11-21","edition":"臺大歷史系學術通訊4（2009），頁24。","extent":"節錄誌陽官爵及家庭相關文字。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":true,"rights":"原誌為古代文字，現代釋文保留出處。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/","section_locator":"source-evidence/jin067-wen-children/reading.json","witness_pdf_sha256":"1dfa2f5b81